  m_text: "Mission 5 - \u201CFinal showdown\u201D\n\nThis is it pilot. the final
    battle for man and bug kind. \n\nwe located the hives core.\n\nbut something
    monstrous awaits there.\n\nour scientists believe its death will throw the bug
    swarm into chaos, making it possible to exterminate them all for good.\n\nwe
    know nothing about it.\nwe know not what its capable of.  \nyou're going in blind.
    \nand humanities survival rests on your shoulder.\n. . .\ngood luck Pilot!"
